    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pullstation is a short, incremental tower defence about saving your space station from\u00a0from the ever-growing horde of UNKNOWN origin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against unknown enemies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/82591608741f115169f960b53253fa26.poster.avif?t=1750001130\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/82591608741f115169f960b53253fa26.webm?t=1750001130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/82591608741f115169f960b53253fa26.mp4?t=1750001130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and unlock new towers and abilites.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/15ecfceba34b75c893232038fc3066be.poster.avif?t=1750001130\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/15ecfceba34b75c893232038fc3066be.webm?t=1750001130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/15ecfceba34b75c893232038fc3066be.mp4?t=1750001130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate space ship!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/96251a3352a53d806fd586fb1745afa9.poster.avif?t=1750001130\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/96251a3352a53d806fd586fb1745afa9.webm?t=1750001130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/96251a3352a53d806fd586fb1745afa9.mp4?t=1750001130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock special prestige upgrades!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/714b611746022ba17da9f3c25ea77601.poster.avif?t=1750001130\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/714b611746022ba17da9f3c25ea77601.webm?t=1750001130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640300/extras/714b611746022ba17da9f3c25ea77601.mp4?t=1750001130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
